utoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "36VR18ppbfOcEQtUlkpr", "type": "text", "x": 1340.0, "y": 5626.0, "width": 520.0, "height": 123.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1501567526, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1700533115, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1730000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\u2022 .container-fluid: padding clamp(1rem,4vw,3rem); max 1200 / 1440 / 1760 at 3xl\n\u2022 .grid-auto: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,18rem),1fr)) \u2014 no breakpoint needed\n\u2022 Container queries (.cq) so cards react to their slot, not viewport\n\u2022 Fluid type with clamp(); 100dvh for hero; safe-area insets\n\u2022 Tables \u2192 card lists < 768px; filters \u2192 bottom sheet\n\u2022 Sticky purchase/estimate panels \u2192 fixed bottom bar on mobile\n\u2022 Sidebar dashboards: \u22651024 fixed, 768\u20131023 collapsible rail, <768 drawer + bottom tabs\n\u2022 Hero canvas density \u221d area; reduced-motion = static\n\u2022 Verify at 375 / 768 / 1440 / 2560 for every page (Antigravity workflow: verify-ui)", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 .container-fluid: padding clamp(1rem,4vw,3rem); max 1200 / 1440 / 1760 at 3xl\n\u2022 .grid-auto: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,18rem),1fr)) \u2014 no breakpoint needed\n\u2022 Container queries (.cq) so cards react to their slot, not viewport\n\u2022 Fluid type with clamp(); 100dvh for hero; safe-area insets\n\u2022 Tables \u2192 card lists < 768px; filters \u2192 bottom sheet\n\u2022 Sticky purchase/estimate panels \u2192 fixed bottom bar on mobile\n\u2022 Sidebar dashboards: \u22651024 fixed, 768\u20131023 collapsible rail, <768 drawer + bottom tabs\n\u2022 Hero canvas density \u221d are