ths, emiIssuer", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Razorpay Checkout lists eligible issuers/tenures\n\u2022 Bank handles repayment; we get full amount\n\u2022 \"No-cost EMI\" only if offered by issuer + enabled in dashboard\n\u2022 Stored: Payment.method, emiTenureMonths, emiIssuer", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "MB4N85bDqYKLeLR0LsFw", "type": "rectangle", "x": 640.0, "y": 37624.0, "width": 570.0, "height": 170.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1319653948, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 399570081, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1730000000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "RXgxnYORhNVq2zckwfMV", "type": "text", "x": 654.0, "y": 37634.0, "width": 540.0, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1409539323, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 65583101, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1730000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "B \u00b7 Softcapphyjas Installments", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "B \u00b7 Softcapphyjas Installments", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "dW7IFubmR6obtm0iKT2e", "type": "text", "x": 654.0, "y": 37662.0, "width": 545.0, "height": 55.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 339181363, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 455635982, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1730000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\u2022 Down payment now (e.g. 25%), rest in 2\u20136 monthly parts\n\u2022 Collected via Razorpay Subscriptions / UPI AutoPay / pay links\n\u2022 Access policy: unlock at down payment OR drip per paid instalment\n\u2022 Stored: InstallmentPlan + Installment[] (status, dueDate)", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 9, "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2022 Down payment now (e.g. 25%), rest in 2\u20136 monthly parts\n\u2022 Collected via Razorpay Subscriptions / UPI AutoPay / pay links\n\u2022 Access policy: unlock at down payment OR drip per paid instalment\n\u2022 Stored: InstallmentPlan + Installment[] (status, dueDate)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "94Rxgunowq4JlH4PLxef", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1240.0, "y": 37624.0, "width": 570.0, "height": 170.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2019109117, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 719924851, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1730000000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "5J5YzTYuCs6x7MFMDHsX", "type": "text", "x": 1254.0, "y": 37634.0, "width": 540.0, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1637233713, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 867625115, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1730000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "C \u00b7 Display calculator (UI only)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign":